  "citation": "Hopple A; Pfeifer-Meister L; Zalman C; Keller J; Tfaily M; Wilson R; Chanton J; Bridgham S (2019): SPRUCE Does dissolved organic matter or solid peat fuel anerobic respiration in peatlands?: Supporting Data. ORNL Terrestrial Ecosystem Science SFA. Dataset. doi:10.25581/SPRUCE.062/1500027",
