    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Please refer to Hopple et al. (2019) for site selection, sampling, and analysis details.\nThree Sphagnum-dominated peatlands in northern Minnesota, U.S.A were sampled in this study. Bog Lake Fen and S1 Bog are located within the Marcell Experimental Forest (U.S. Forest Service). Zim Bog is an ombrotrophic bog located approximately 90 km northwest of Duluth, Minnesota. These sites have been described in detail previously (Medvedeff et al., 2015; Zalman et al., 2018).Soil samples were collected in June 2013 and July 2014, while porewater samples were collected in July 2013."
